<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= pageTitle %> - BioCultDB</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50">

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="bg-forest-700 text-white shadow-lg">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-4">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <img src="/images/logo.png" alt="BioCultDB Logo" class="h-16 w-16">
        <div>
          <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold"><%= contextName %></h1>
          <p class="text-forest-100 text-sm"><%= contextDescription %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <nav class="bg-forest-600 text-white border-b border-forest-800">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <ul class="flex gap-0">
        <li>
          <a href="/" class="block px-6 py-2 hover:bg-forest-700 transition-colors border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-forest-300 text-sm">
            Entrada de Dados
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/extraction-prompt" class="block px-6 py-2 hover:bg-forest-700 transition-colors border-b-2 border-forest-400 font-medium text-sm">
            Prompt de Extração
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/extracao-ia" class="block px-6 py-2 hover:bg-forest-700 transition-colors border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-forest-300 text-sm">
            Extração por IA
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">

      <% if (saved) { %>
        <div class="mb-6 bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-lg p-4 text-green-800">
          Prompt salvo.
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <section class="card">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Prompt de Extração</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
            Última alteração:
            <span class="font-medium text-gray-700"><%= new Date(updatedAt).toLocaleString('pt-BR') %></span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">
          Este texto instrui a IA sobre o que extrair de um artigo e em que formato devolver, na
          Extração por IA. Ele vai <strong>literalmente</strong> (verbatim) para o modelo — preserve
          exatamente a indentação, as aspas e o bloco JSON.
        </p>

        <form method="POST" action="/extraction-prompt">
          <textarea
            name="prompt"
            rows="30"
            spellcheck="false"
            class="w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-forest-500 focus:border-forest-500 font-mono text-sm whitespace-pre"
          ><%= prompt %></textarea>

          <div class="flex justify-end gap-3 mt-4">
            <button type="submit" formaction="/extraction-prompt/reset" class="btn btn-secondary">
              Restaurar Padrão
            </button>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
              Salvar
            </button>
          </div>
        </form>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="bg-gray-800 text-white py-6 mt-12">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 text-center">
      <p class="text-sm">BioCultDB - Base de Dados Etnobotânica</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-1">Eduardo Dalcin - 2025/2026</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
        <a href="https://github.com/edalcin/BioCultDB" target="_blank" class="hover:text-forest-300">https://github.com/edalcin/BioCultDB</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
